    "title": "27 Pork Recipes Ready for a Saturday Full of College Football - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Mandy V Applegate ,\n21 hours ago A full Saturday of college football calls for food that works from the first game through the final whistle. These 27 pork recipes cover bite-sized snacks, loaded sliders, hearty dinners, and slow cooker dishes that can be started before kickoff. There are quick options for halftime, larger meals for a break between games, and plenty of finger foods for anyone watching from the couch. Whether you’re feeding a few people or setting out food for a crowd, there’s something here for every part of the day. Read full article",
